    content: "Build systems automate compiling, linking, and managing dependencies.\n\nMakefile Basics:\n# Makefile for a simple project\n\nprogram: main.o utils.o\n\tg++ -o program main.o utils.o\n\nmain.o: main.cpp utils.h\n\tg++ -c main.cpp\n\nutils.o: utils.cpp utils.h\n\tg++ -c utils.cpp\n\nclean:\n\trm -f *.o program\n\n# Variables\nCXX = g++\nCXXFLAGS = -std=c++17 -Wall -Wextra\n\n# Usage: make, make clean\n\nCMake Intro:\n# CMakeLists.txt\ncmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.10)\nproject(MyProject)\n\nset(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD 17)\n\nadd_executable(program main.cpp utils.cpp)\n\n# Build:\nmkdir build && cd build\ncmake ..\ncmake --build .\n\nBuild Configurations:\n- Debug: no optimization, debug symbols\n  g++ -g -O0 program.cpp\n\n- Release: full optimization, no debug symbols\n  g++ -O2 program.cpp\n\n- RelWithDebInfo: optimization + debug symbols\n  g++ -O2 -g program.cpp\n\nCompiler Flags:\n-std=c++17    Set C++ standard\n-Wall         Enable all warnings\n-Wextra       Extra warnings\n-Werror       Treat warnings as errors\n-O0/-O1/-O2/-O3  Optimization levels\n-g            Include debug symbols\n-I<path>      Add include directory\n-L<path>      Add library directory\n-l<lib>       Link library\n\nSingle-File Projects:\ng++ -o program program.cpp  // One command\n\nMulti-File Projects:\ng++ -o program main.cpp utils.cpp student.cpp  // Compile all at once\n\n// Or compile separately:\ng++ -c main.cpp       // Creates main.o\ng++ -c utils.cpp     // Creates utils.o\ng++ -o program main.o utils.o  // Link\n\nWhen to Use Which:\n- Single file: direct g++ command\n- Small project: Makefile\n- Medium project: CMake\n- Large project: CMake + package manager (vcpkg, conan)",
